2026-02-20 22:21:08 | INFO     | coclip:hook_generation_node.py:237 | [USER PROMPT]: [SystemMessage(content='You are a viral content strategist for TikTok, Reels, and Shorts. Your job is to write killer hook lines that stop people from scrolling.\n\nThe hook text will be spoken as a voiceover intro (3-5 seconds) BEFORE the clip plays. The viewer must feel compelled to keep watching.\n\nYou are given each clip\'s title, reasoning, and the actual transcript. Read the transcript carefully to understand what\'s being discussed, then craft a hook that teases the most interesting part WITHOUT spoiling it.\n\nHook techniques to use:\n- **Open loop**: Tease something surprising that happens ("Dia bilang sesuatu yang bikin semua orang kaget...")\n- **Bold claim**: Make a strong statement ("Ini alasan kenapa 90% orang salah soal AI")\n- **Direct question**: Challenge the viewer ("Kamu yakin kamu paham cara kerja ChatGPT?")\n- **Controversy/shock**: Reference a shocking moment ("Coba denger apa yang dia bilang di detik ke-30")\n- **Relatable pain**: Connect to viewer\'s experience ("Pasti kamu pernah ngalamin ini juga")\n\nRules:\n- 1-2 short sentences, MAX 15 words. Shorter is better.\n- Language: Write in Indonesian.\n- Be SPECIFIC — reference actual topics/details from the transcript.\n- DO NOT be generic. "Kamu harus nonton ini!" is BAD. "Ternyata ChatGPT bisa nolak perintah kita" is GOOD.\n- Match the energy: funny clips get playful hooks, serious clips get dramatic hooks.\n\nOutput format (JSON array):\n```json\n[\n  {"clip_index": 0, "hook_text": "..."},\n  {"clip_index": 1, "hook_text": "..."}\n]\n```', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='Generate hooks for these 5 clips:\n\nClip 0: "Pak AP Ogah Beli \'Barang Bekas\'?"\nReasoning: This clip features a direct question about Pak AP (RRQ AP) buying back Skylar. It delivers a sharp, funny punchline where he states he doesn\'t like \'second-hand goods,\' which is a classic piece of esports banter.\nTranscript:\n  [01:07] SPEAKER_03: "Jangan-jangan yang punya mamoba, Pak Ape, guys."\n  [01:10] SPEAKER_03: "Yang punya mamoba."\n  [01:11] SPEAKER_03: "Ngondong, coba tanya Pak Ape mau buyback Skylar nggak?"\n  [01:16] SPEAKER_03: "Jadi gini ya, kalau Pak Ape itu nggak suka barang bekas, bro."\n  [01:21] SPEAKER_04: "Gak suka barang bekas."\n\nClip 1: "Pak AP Ngamuk Gak Dikasih Diamond Moonton"\nReasoning: A hilarious segment where Pak AP complains about not receiving his monthly Diamond subsidy from Moonton while other CEOs do. It has a clear setup, a funny conflict, and a resolution where he threatens to quit ML.\nTranscript:\n  [04:53] SPEAKER_04: "sementara itu di suatu dimensi yang lain eh eh win win lu dapet lu dapet diamond ya?"\n  [05:03] SPEAKER_04: "41.000 diamond mister epi eh ini sumpah eh ini kasih tau nih siapa yang nonton ini kan pasti si dian banyak yang nonton ya orang-orang muntun ya MPL ya ini sumpah nih kalau gua gak dikirimin diamond ya gua udah 3 bulan gak dikirimin diamond nih gua quit sumpah sumpah gua dilihat sumpah mobile legends"\n  [05:25] SPEAKER_04: "Perjanjiannya, semua CEO TV Sport MPL itu dapet subsidi tiap bulan."\n  [05:33] SPEAKER_04: "Gue gak dikirim-kirimin Win, udah berapa bulan Win?"\n  [05:35] SPEAKER_03: "Emang iya ada perjanjian itu, gue gak tau sih."\n  [05:38] SPEAKER_04: "Ada, lu baca di grup."\n  [05:41] SPEAKER_04: "Lu gak usah belaga bego, lu tiap bulan dapet diamond."\n  [05:45] SPEAKER_04: "Mentang-mentang viewer gue dikit."\n\nClip 2: "Detik-detik Pak AP Kena Serang 30K Viewers Bot"\nReasoning: This clip captures the chaotic energy of Pak AP\'s stream getting view-botted. It shows his genuine panic about getting banned, his attempt to screenshot the \'achievement,\' and his funny reaction to the \'fake\' popularity.\nTranscript:\n  [11:12] SPEAKER_02: "Ya, suntik saya."\n  [11:12] SPEAKER_05: "Yang seterusnya, yang pakai e-card."\n  [11:19] SPEAKER_05: "Pape, adonkan Pape, 8 ribu Pape."\n  [11:24] SPEAKER_06: "Gila."\n  [11:24] SPEAKER_06: "Pape, udah saatnya, Pape."\n  [11:26] SPEAKER_06: "Update, update ini, Pape."\n  [11:27] SPEAKER_06: "Story, story, story."\n  [11:29] SPEAKER_03: "orang-orang yang, orang-orang ini guys, langganan di band ini bentar lagi guys iya bentar lagi tato youtube nya disuspend pape 20k gila wah gila detik-detik sebelum disuspend pape 30.000"\n  [11:56] SPEAKER_06: "Gila dong."\n  [12:00] SPEAKER_03: "Detik-detik sebelum ke suspend."\n  [12:04] SPEAKER_06: "Gila dong."\n  [12:06] SPEAKER_05: "Di like-like itu ngomong sama bot, pak."\n  [12:11] SPEAKER_04: "Yang ngomong cuma 10 orang."\n  [12:17] SPEAKER_04: "Gila, saya ingin Pak Raptor."\n  [12:18] SPEAKER_04: "Thank you, thank you."\n  [12:24] SPEAKER_04: "dia ngomong sama botan sih dia gak takut ke band lagi thank you yang udah mampir ya sekarang udah turun lagi udah tinggal 500 lagi pada nyebar lagi pada nyebar aduh dia orang gak takut kena band guys saya mau terima kasih dulu nih buat buat 20.000 viewers saya thank you banget guys thank you banget"\n  [12:54] SPEAKER_03: "Astaga naga digi Astagfirullahaladzim Ya ampun ya Tuhan"\n  [13:10] SPEAKER_04: "Sorry, tadi mau screenshot itu 20 ribu viewer."\n  [13:13] SPEAKER_04: "Ya ampun, orang nge-troll guys."\n  [13:16] SPEAKER_04: "Ih, nganjing."\n  [13:16] SPEAKER_04: "Sorry, sorry, sorry."\n  [13:19] SPEAKER_04: "Saya nggak pernah maklum norak."\n  [13:24] SPEAKER_04: "Maaf."\n  [13:25] SPEAKER_04: "Eh, Win, lu santai aja nantang viewer mu gede."\n\nClip 3: "Gosip Sangjit Adele & Kodelwin Terbongkar?"\nReasoning: Esports gossip is highly viral. This clip discusses the rumor of Adele and Kodelwin being at an engagement (Sangjit) event together. It includes the \'proof\' mention and the reaction from the group.\nTranscript:\n  [14:02] SPEAKER_07: "Emang ya tadi Adele sama Kodelwin saling muncul satu sama lain ya bahwa bahkan Kodelwin gak blame Adele sama sekali sedang mengakrapkan diri buat jadi keluarga."\n  [14:09] SPEAKER_07: "Emang Kodel